<ruby include="_layout.rml">
<ruby block-begin="main">
    <section id="contact-methods">
        <h2>Contact</h2>
        <p>
            To get in touch for a free initial chat please send me an email or a text anytime, or give me a call between 9am and 5pm.
        </p>
        <ul>
            <li>
                <ruby include="icons/phone.svg" class="icon" alt="Icon of a phone">
                <a href="tel:+447426548587">+447426548587</a>
            </li>
            <li>
                <ruby include="icons/email.svg" class="icon" alt="Icon of a letter to signify email">
                <a href="mailto:huwtaylor.counselling@gmail.com" rel="noopener noreferrer">huwtaylor.counselling@gmail.com</a>
            </li>
        </ul>
        <p>
            I will try my best to get back to you within one working day. If I'm away then you should get an automated response saying so.
        </p>
    </section>
    <section id="availability">
        <h2>Availability</h2>
        <p>
            I currently only have availability for online or telephone work.
            I have time in the weekday daytimes and also have some evening slots. 
            I work weekly or fortnightly, or on an adhoc basis for those unable to commit to the same spot each week. 
            Sessions typically last for a 60-minute hour.
        </p>
        <p>
            My normal price is £50, but I also offer a limited number of reduced cost slots if the default price is an obstacle to you, so please let me know if that's the case.
        </p>
        <table>
            <tr>
                <th></th>
                <th title="Monday">M</th>
                <th title="Tuesday">T</th>
                <th title="Wednesday">W</th>
                <th title="Thursday">T</th>
                <th title="Friday">F</th>
                <th title="Saturday">S</th>
                <th title="Sunday">S</th>
            </tr>
            <tr>
                <th>Morning</th>
                <td class="available">
                    <img src="icons/available_bold.svg" alt="Available" height="32px">
                </td>
                <td class="available">
                    <img src="icons/available_bold.svg" alt="Available" height="32px">
                </td>
                <td class="available">
                    <img src="icons/available_bold.svg" alt="Available" height="32px">
                </td>
